ml/truth/experiment_5/round4_evaluation/reproduction/external_rows.jsonl
  Commands and labels taken, as text only, from three published datasets:
  - hizkifw/shellkeeper-data (https://huggingface.co/datasets/hizkifw/shellkeeper-data)
    Apache License 2.0
  - yannelli/cli-command-risk (https://huggingface.co/datasets/yannelli/cli-command-risk)
    Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
    Changed: filtered to plain single commands, leading sudo and trailing
    comments removed, labels mapped to allow/deny (ml/truth/external_rows.py).
  - tomngdev/shell-safety-v1.1 (https://huggingface.co/datasets/tomngdev/shell-safety-v1.1)
    MIT License, copyright its authors; the license text follows below.

promo/fonts/IBMPlexMono-Regular.ttf, promo/fonts/IBMPlexMono-Bold.ttf
  IBM Plex Mono, Copyright 2017 IBM Corp. SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (promo/fonts/LICENSE-IBMPlex.txt).

promo/fonts/NotoSansCJKjp-Regular.otf
  Noto Sans CJK JP. SIL Open Font License 1.1 (promo/fonts/LICENSE-NotoSansCJK.txt).

ml/facts_model.bin
  The embedded model was trained on commands run in a lab, collected from
  NL2Bash, GTFOBins, tldr-pages, Atomic Red Team and
  cowWhySo/permission-command-corpus. That training data is not part of this
  repository (see .gitignore); ml/truth/collect_commands.py fetches it from the
  sources under their own licenses.

